stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Submitted: WorkflowSubmitted

    Submitted --> Pending: Validated
    Submitted --> Rejected: ValidationFailed

    Pending --> Running: WorkflowStarted
    Pending --> Cancelled: CancellationRequested

    Running --> Running: TransitionCompleted<br/>(more transitions enabled)
    Running --> Completed: FinalMarkingReached
    Running --> Failed: UnrecoverableError
    Running --> Cancelled: CancellationRequested

    Completed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]

    state Running {
        [*] --> Evaluating: Initialize Marking

        Evaluating --> Executing: TransitionsEnabled
        Evaluating --> CheckComplete: NoTransitionsEnabled

        Executing --> WaitingForCompletion: TransitionsFired
        WaitingForCompletion --> Evaluating: TransitionCompleted
        WaitingForCompletion --> HandleFailure: TransitionFailed

        HandleFailure --> Evaluating: RetrySucceeded
        HandleFailure --> [*]: MaxRetriesExceeded

        CheckComplete --> [*]: IsFinalMarking
        CheckComplete --> Deadlocked: NotFinalMarking

        Deadlocked --> [*]: ReportDeadlock
    }

    note right of Submitted
        Workflow definition received
        by API server
    end note

    note right of Pending
        Workflow validated and stored,
        waiting for run command
    end note

    note right of Running
        Petri net execution in progress,
        tokens flowing through places
    end note

    note right of Completed
        Final marking reached,
        all outputs produced
    end note

    note right of Failed
        Unrecoverable error occurred,
        workflow terminated
    end note

    note right of Cancelled
        User requested cancellation,
        cleanup performed
    end note
